            <div xml:id="m-98b5bc3f-538d-4f4f-961c-0ff96d1383dc">
              <lg xml:id="m-97b6077c-770f-4d71-ab23-6b5b7d729c7b">
                <l xml:id="m-f311abaf-b2ba-4dc7-b6bf-f38438fe29d3" facs="#m-84aa6b8d-448f-4e20-83a1-e6ec839fa29a" label="text-like">4th Sunday after Easter.</l><l xml:id="m-4c707c7e-6b5e-422f-ad3e-5826709276d9" facs="#m-662ef3cc-162e-4e52-9cde-4ffe37557495" label="ambiguous">827</l><l xml:id="m-bed6f577-60d7-485f-9189-1551e2334a04" facs="#m-9391e486-4879-4233-97f8-a1e5af369e59" label="lyrics-like">nuit nos verbo veritátis, ut simus! justítiam Dei non operátur. Propter</l><l xml:id="m-43cbeaff-a85d-4433-9cbf-b8c65343e202" facs="#m-e58c5f57-524f-4f8b-96b4-eead126c6efd" label="lyrics-like">initium áliquod creatúrae ejus. Sci¬</l><l xml:id="m-1ced7f08-50ec-459e-8dcf-af4d9b7aad8d" facs="#m-a077a4a7-b247-4862-80ca-a531ab79ff3b" label="lyrics-like">quod abiiciéntes omnem immundi¬</l><l xml:id="m-b45a5282-10f2-4db7-8e08-adbb0f50879b" facs="#m-e5f159a3-dbec-4d93-87c4-b422a83f31d3" label="ambiguous">tis, fratres mei dilectissimi. Sit au¬</l><l xml:id="m-ba53d9d3-914f-490a-9af2-61c86f9a96a4" facs="#m-8e122d51-0d6d-4330-8cc1-2c207aaa299f" label="lyrics-like">tiam, et abundántiam malitiae, in</l><l xml:id="m-0df4f859-3e0f-4c6b-aaf2-d2c098a95c9c" facs="#m-588731da-9807-4731-af28-aff24e7f5c68" label="lyrics-like">tem omnis homo velox ad audién¬</l><l xml:id="m-d6c6391f-07e2-408a-96d6-0a549735677e" facs="#m-b2f448f1-306a-4b25-a61e-7a75b1f2b410" label="lyrics-like">mansuetúdine suscípite insitum ver¬</l><l xml:id="m-3ac5f227-e2a3-41b3-8c41-68a61e75fc03" facs="#m-09f92820-fecb-47d9-8b60-7755e5d11194" label="lyrics-like">bum, quod potest salváre ánimas</l><l xml:id="m-26436775-1854-48ef-8c9a-3d13cd0210c8" facs="#m-2750e6e5-3a5b-4775-86f5-760e7858ea03" label="lyrics-like">dum: tardus autem ad loquéndum,</l><l xml:id="m-4860c8d5-5496-4c9e-91a3-571ba625d75a" facs="#m-c1570f49-e001-438d-b07b-fc46346c91d3" label="ambiguous">et tardus ad iram. Ira enim viri, l vestras.</l><l xml:id="m-a1401584-65c0-484e-a2bb-13e9b3181ad8" facs="#m-0c6cd46b-1840-4e01-b0f7-ad9bda3aca58" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-509679db-0dae-4eaf-880b-a94cf954888a" facs="#m-e74a04e4-0133-48cb-b26e-34a83ef74915" label="lyrics-like">L ledúia.</l><l xml:id="m-adeb6a92-c636-4ae6-b87c-24657963f951" facs="#m-d485347d-6169-464e-90a4-62c2cea899a9" label="ambiguous">ii</l><l xml:id="m-f5e01703-e942-4603-b1b5-024dba60503f" facs="#m-8be3ca0d-dd19-4e59-a5b1-bc4756ff1aa8" label="lyrics-like">V. Déx¬</l><l xml:id="m-2f77a061-0d24-4032-975e-9b578a7ba9b6" facs="#m-fa9b5cb9-f992-4c9d-b2bd-3a43b8917c5a" label="lyrics-like">te- ra Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-aa5a7e9f-155c-4467-8cb5-0a953e7fd0d1" facs="#m-35d3c78f-b228-4600-bd4e-1a648b551a36" label="ambiguous">i</l><l xml:id="m-16ac5552-b5a0-43ec-ab8b-8cb6bcae1002" facs="#m-8036f103-1e4c-40cb-b46e-6faa9ae56c8c" label="lyrics-like">fé¬ cit virtú¬ tem : déxte-ra Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-d7c93af1-0b09-40c7-a417-6d36ff5b6d20" facs="#m-f245c34f-8972-43a6-9950-7e64bb0c1b70" label="lyrics-like">ni “ ex- altávit me.</l><l xml:id="m-bd1a42de-dd67-4c02-ae06-8350c7237a63" facs="#m-117db8e7-0274-44f2-8507-103c0d255c72" label="ambiguous">mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-eff618c2-16f4-4aa6-b992-2d29c5570a51" facs="#m-e69eb591-497a-4553-9ef6-e6d4c5b4664a" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-cb1423c0-b538-45d0-8c98-fe8d26b8fed1" facs="#m-cd363c8e-ea2a-4772-80ca-7194e34c5a16" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-05b705f1-d013-4527-a580-caf55a8aa26f" facs="#m-bdaf3bb7-daa9-4643-88e1-df3d8e1070b8" label="ambiguous">Lle¬</l><l xml:id="m-905f4dea-b2d6-418e-bbad-23a5a70ba2f7" facs="#m-b8a6f7f9-d8b5-4b5c-8b38-c7f62b3f7562" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia.</l><l xml:id="m-fdedb42a-7fbc-422a-bce2-3448239ac57d" facs="#m-1dfdc3d2-6b69-44bd-8189-424913872c1a" label="lyrics-like">V. Chrístus</l><l xml:id="m-f8e0d2ac-4d86-449e-9383-0e6595f92151" facs="#m-72dc2427-d11f-43f0-b3f5-8e1e03381432" label="lyrics-like">re-súr¬</l><l xml:id="m-7d5c8cd2-14f2-4295-8298-1340197aed6c" facs="#m-2bcaf99f-0664-435c-9efb-327a55d9c1fd" label="lyrics-like">gens ex mór¬</l><l xml:id="m-fb87d4da-66dc-4eff-8ecf-2e1023cecf75" facs="#m-c3eaa1c7-7fda-4c90-824c-0122187d9c7a" label="ambiguous">tu-is, jam</l><l xml:id="m-ca02255d-d6c1-4631-932a-5e62cd1c8a67" facs="#m-1fd11624-196c-4854-a02e-d18da18292c1" label="lyrics-like">non mó-ri-tur : mors</l><l xml:id="m-21f33650-b674-4cad-93bb-fc3c0245a9cc" facs="#m-0977bd66-9765-4b64-996b-49e4fc2df60e" label="ambiguous">Il- li ultra</l><l xml:id="m-8cbf1228-fa1a-40a4-9563-5b90125345ee" facs="#m-dd2bc462-b6fa-4d6b-b570-88de75a6de52" label="ambiguous">non do¬</l><l xml:id="m-3c89c033-711c-4cbb-9389-cd7ee8cfe97f" facs="#m-f925fc1a-81d5-4c4d-a865-15ada33b744e" label="lyrics-like">mi-ná-bi-tur.</l></lg>
